  "title": "Coconut Custard Pie III",
  "description": "This is a thick, creamy and wonderfully sweet custard pie filled with lots of coconut. It bakes up beautifully and is terrific served with unsweetened whipped cream with a dusting of nutmeg.",
  "authors": [
    "Susan Hadobas"
